          "id": 926316881,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Argh, this is a very tricky case. Features like Follow TLS Stream and Decode As might also be unreliable with TLS-over-TLS.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
