        },
        {
          "id": 927718054,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "TLS tunneled over TLS is fairly rare, but \"a single frame contains more than one TLS layer\" can be more common, say with an encapsulation like GSE or MPE over MP2TS where there are multiple IP packets in a frame.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
